            "reliability": "primary",
            "text": "Penbrothers seeks a product-minded Full Stack Engineer to build and ship end-to-end product experiences across frontend, backend, cloud infrastructure, and product execution. The posting specifies React, Next.js, TypeScript, Node.js, APIs, databases, AWS/serverless systems, deployment, monitoring, and AI-assisted development, with a minimum of 5+ years of professional software engineering experience.",
