      "notes": "Applied through Indeed for the fully remote Full Stack Engineer role at Penbrothers. Indeed URL: https://ph.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=2267594ba7832cc1&from=shareddesktop_copy. The role is full-time, day shift 9:00 AM-6:00 PM Philippine time with flexible AEST overlap. Verified requirements include React, Next.js, TypeScript, Node.js, APIs, databases, AWS/serverless systems, product ownership, deployment, monitoring, and AI-assisted development. A cover letter PDF was created at records/cover-letter-penbrothers-full-stack-engineer.pdf and includes the portfolio URL www.justintagarda.com. Application questions were answered regarding identity verification consent, Indeed as the source, no referral, other pending applications, availability, prior Penbrothers employment, contact methods, and end-to-end product experience. A prior JobStreet application for the same or closely matching Penbrothers role was cancelled; this Indeed application was subsequently submitted. Penbrothers acknowledgment email from noreply@recruiterflowmail.com confirmed receipt of the Full Stack Engineer application and stated that the team will review it and respond shortly. Penbrothers Talent Acquisition Team email from talentacquisition@penbrothers.com confirmed applications are under review; candidates whose qualifications closely match may receive a link to an initial AI interview to complete at their convenience, and applications may be retained for future opportunities. Indeed applications generally do not require a cover letter unless the employer separately requests one."
