      "cover_letter": "Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am applying for the Senior AWS Fullstack Engineer position. I am a senior full-stack developer with extensive experience building, maintaining, and supporting production applications using C#, .NET, REST APIs, SQL Server, React, Next.js, and TypeScript.\n\nMy experience aligns with the role's focus on end-to-end delivery, dependable systems, and production ownership. I have built API-driven business applications, dashboards, customer portals, and data-driven workflows, while working across backend services, frontend interfaces, databases, deployments, monitoring, troubleshooting, and ongoing support. My recent work included Docker and IIS-based deployments, Azure DevOps workflows, production server migrations, SQL Server administration, and incident response during service downtime.\n\nMy recent professional experience has been primarily in the .NET and Microsoft ecosystem rather than AWS/CDK. However, I bring a strong foundation in full-stack architecture, cloud-adjacent deployment operations, API integration, relational databases, and maintaining business-critical systems. I am comfortable learning new infrastructure tooling and contributing immediately where my existing engineering and production-support experience can provide value.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my full-stack delivery and operational experience could support your team. My résumé is attached, and selected projects are available at https://justintagarda.com.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nJustiniano Tagarda"
    },
