      "notes": "Email received from Matt Traynor at matt.traynor@basaltforge.dev confirming that the self-contained take-home technical exercise for the Senior Full Stack Workspace Engineer role was attached. The user submitted the completed exercise on August 3, 2026 through the private GitHub repository https://github.com/JustinTagarda/basalt-forge-technical-screening-exercise and documented the working application, setup and validation instructions, design decisions and tradeoffs, potential future improvements, test-time notes, and AI-assisted development-tool usage and validation. Matt replied that the submission was reviewed in detail, was excellent, and was among the strongest submissions they had seen. Basalt Forge is moving the user to the next stage, a conversation with the CTO, with scheduling expected during the week commencing August 10, 2026. The user previously returned the signed mutual NDA as an attachment."
