      "application_status": "applied",
      "fit_score": 90,
      "fit_summary": "Strong match for the verified C#/.NET background, including SQL Server, legacy ASP.NET applications, long-running business systems, production troubleshooting, technical support, documentation, code reviews, mentoring, and unit/integration testing. The role also asks for an IT-related degree, while the verified education is a BS Commerce degree, so that qualification should be checked in the application form.",
