      "cover_letter": "Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am applying for the C# Developer position at ADEC Innovations. I am a senior .NET backend and full-stack developer with extensive experience building, maintaining, and supporting production business systems using C#, .NET, ASP.NET, SQL Server, and REST APIs.\n\nMy background aligns well with this role's focus on complex web and desktop applications, legacy systems, technical design, troubleshooting, documentation, and high-level support. I have developed internal business applications, ERP and inventory workflows, customer portals, reporting dashboards, and production APIs. I have also supported systems operating over many years, administered SQL Server and IIS environments, led production migrations, conducted code improvements and reviews, and provided incident support during service downtime.\n\nI bring hands-on experience across the software lifecycle, including requirements clarification, system design, implementation, testing, deployment, technical documentation, and ongoing maintenance. I have worked directly with clients and stakeholders, collaborated across teams, and delivered practical software for real operational needs. My experience also includes mentoring and supporting other users and technical staff through complex troubleshooting and system issues.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute my C#/.NET, SQL Server, legacy ASP.NET, production-support, and business-systems experience to ADEC Innovations. My résumé is attached, and selected projects are available at https://justintagarda.com.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nJustiniano Tagarda"
