      "location": "Metro Manila (Remote)",
      "application_status": "applied",
      "fit_score": 68,
      "fit_summary": "Partial fit through the verified Microsoft stack, C#, .NET, cross-platform application delivery, production software, testing, stakeholder collaboration, and mobile/desktop product experience. The user also develops mobile applications using Flutter and Dart. .NET MAUI, AWS application deployment, and production Android/iOS delivery are not verified in the career records.",
      "cover_letter_status": "drafted_with_gap_notice",
      "recruiter_name": null,
      "last_activity": "application_submitted",
      "next_action": "Wait for employer feedback.",
      "notes": "Full-time remote role, Monday-Friday day shift. Salary listed as PHP 130,000-150,000 per month. Requires .NET MAUI, C#, XAML, AWS, Android/iOS deployment, and a desktop/laptop with backup internet and power.",
      "cover_letter": "Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am applying for the .NET Mobile Application Developer (.NET MAUI) position. I am a senior .NET developer with extensive experience building, maintaining, and supporting production applications using C#, .NET, REST APIs, SQL Server, and modern frontend technologies.\n\nMy background aligns with this role's focus on owning features from solution design through development, testing, deployment, and support. I have delivered web, desktop, and cross-platform applications, translated business requirements into practical software, worked directly with stakeholders, and supported products through production operations and ongoing improvement.\n\nIn addition to my .NET experience, I am also developing mobile applications using Flutter and Dart, including applications published on the Microsoft Store and Google Play. This cross-platform development experience has strengthened my understanding of mobile application structure, responsive user experiences, integration, testing, release workflows, and supporting applications beyond the development environment.\n\nMy strongest verified experience is in C#/.NET and cross-platform application delivery rather than .NET MAUI and AWS specifically. However, I bring a strong Microsoft-stack foundation, production ownership, testing experience, client collaboration, and a practical ability to learn adjacent technologies. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute those strengths while expanding further into .NET MAUI, AWS deployment, and mobile application delivery across Android and iOS.\n\nMy résumé is attached, and selected projects are available at https://justintagarda.com. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nJustiniano Tagarda"
    },
