      "cover_letter": "Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am applying for the Full Stack Developer (Frontend & Backend) position at Remote Employee BPO Phil Inc. I am a full-stack .NET developer with extensive experience building, maintaining, and supporting production applications using C#, .NET, REST APIs, SQL Server, React, Next.js, TypeScript, and Git-based development workflows.\n\nMy background aligns well with this role’s focus on frontend and backend development, clean and maintainable code, production troubleshooting, and remote collaboration. I have delivered APIs, dashboards, customer portals, internal business systems, and data-driven interfaces, while working across requirements clarification, implementation, testing, deployment, debugging, and ongoing production support. I have also collaborated directly with clients and stakeholders to turn business requirements into practical software solutions.\n\nI bring a strong foundation in full-stack application development, relational databases, Git/GitHub workflows, documentation, and production ownership. My strongest verified experience is in .NET-based systems and application delivery, while I am continuing to expand into broader cloud environments and AI-enabled product workflows. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute my engineering experience and learn the specific platform and AWS practices used by your team.\n\nMy résumé is attached, and selected projects are available at https://justintagarda.com.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nJustiniano Tagarda",
