      "cover_letter": "Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am applying for the Software Engineer / Backend position at ACP Computer Training & Consultancy Pte Ltd. I am a senior backend and full-stack developer with extensive experience designing, building, and supporting production software using C#, .NET, ASP.NET, REST APIs, SQL Server, PostgreSQL, and modern web technologies.\n\nMy background aligns with this role’s focus on backend architecture, API development, database integrations, system troubleshooting, and dependable software delivery. I have built and maintained production APIs, ERP and inventory systems, customer portals, dashboards, and internal business applications. My work has included translating requirements into technical solutions, improving backend services, optimizing database-backed workflows, deploying applications, monitoring production systems, and resolving operational issues through root-cause analysis.\n\nI also bring experience working independently with stakeholders and distributed teams, documenting technical work, supporting code and release processes, and delivering maintainable software for real business needs. While my strongest verified programming background is in C#/.NET rather than the Java, Spring Boot, Node.js, Python, or C++ technologies listed, I have a solid foundation in backend engineering, system integration, relational databases, and production ownership that would help me contribute effectively while learning the specific stack used by your team.\n\nMy résumé is attached, and selected projects are available at https://justintagarda.com.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nJustiniano Tagarda",
