      "cover_letter": "Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am applying for the Full Stack Developer position at ZigZag Philippines. I am a senior full-stack .NET developer with 15+ years of experience designing, building, deploying, and supporting production applications, APIs, business systems, and data-driven products using C#, .NET, ASP.NET Core, REST APIs, SQL Server, PostgreSQL, React, Next.js, and TypeScript.\n\nMy background aligns with this role’s focus on scalable software, API development, business-process analysis, automation, CI/CD, and reliable delivery. I have built production APIs, ERP and inventory systems, internal dashboards, customer portals, e-commerce solutions, and modern full-stack applications. I have also worked directly with stakeholders to translate operational challenges into technical solutions, improve workflows, troubleshoot production issues, and deliver maintainable software through deployment and ongoing support.\n\nI bring verified experience with GitHub, GitHub Actions, CI/CD practices, secure authentication and data access, PostgreSQL/Supabase, React/Next.js interfaces, and AI-enabled application workflows using OpenAI and Google AI services. My strongest professional backend experience is in C#/.NET rather than Python, and my cloud background is more limited than the AWS-heavy scope described in the posting, but I offer a strong foundation in API architecture, production systems, automation, and full-stack product delivery that would allow me to contribute while deepening my AWS and cloud-native experience.\n\nMy résumé is attached, and selected projects are available at https://www.justintagarda.com\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nJustiniano Tagarda",
